      "text": "{\n  \"originalLesson\": {\n    \"sourceTitle\": \"القلوب تحت تصريف الرحمن\",\n    \"unit\": \"essential-01-003\",\n    \"chapter\": 1,\n    \"namedCommentaryAuthor\": \"An individual author is not identified in the available Arabic lesson.\",\n    \"readerCredit\": \"Арабча таълим матни асосида: 1-боб, 3-дарс. Оятлар таржимаси: «Руввод» таржима маркази. Ибн Аббос дуоси: «Ҳадис ва ҳаёт», 35-жуз.\"\n  },\n  \"Quran\": {\n    \"publisher\": \"Rowwad Translation Center / QuranEnc.com\",\n    \"sourceURL\": \"https://quranenc.com/en/browse/uzbek_rwwad\",\n    \"edition\": \"QuranEnc uzbek_rwwad v1.0.4-csv.1/2023-10-31 13:48:25; actual original CSV transcript including CRLF retained.\",\n    \"actualCatalogue\": \"31/10/2023 - V1.0.4\\nUzbek Translation - Rowwad Translation Center\\nTranslated by the team of the Rowwad Translation Center, in cooperation with the Rabwah Dawah Association, the Islamic Content Service Association in Languages, and the IslamHouse.com website.\\nBrowse Translation\\nShare link\\nShare QR\\nPlease review the\\nTerms and Policies\\nPDF with Quran text\\nPDF Translation only\\nPDF Mobile version\\nEPUB\\nXML\\nCSV\\nExcel\\nSQLite database\\nAPI\",\n    \"transcript\": \"Translation Info:\\r\\n#---------------------------\\r\\n# Translation of the meanings of the Noble Qur'an\\r\\n# Language: Uzbek\\r\\n# Translation ID: uzbek_rwwad\\r\\n# Source: https://quranenc.com\\r\\n# URL: https://quranenc.com/en/browse/uzbek_rwwad\\r\\n# Last update: 2023-10-31 13:48:25 (v1.0.4-csv.1)\\r\\n# Check for updates: https://quranenc.com/check/uzbek_rwwad/v1.0.4-csv.1\\r\\n# PLEASE DON'T REMOVE THIS IMPORTANT INFORMATION!\\r\\n#---------------------------\",\n    \"actualPositiveConditionalTerms\": \"Contents of the translations can be downloaded and re-published, with the following terms and conditions: 1. No modification, addition, or deletion of the content. 2. Clearly referring to the publisher and the source (QuranEnc.com). 3. Mentioning the